{"id": 62, "name": "Kaja", "splash": "https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/mobile-legends/images/8/86/Hero621-portrait.png/revision/latest?cb=20241021142136", "cls": ["Support", "Fighter"], "specialty": ["Control", "Charge"], "difficulty": "50", "stats": ["30", "20", "60", "50"], "lanes": ["Roam", ""], "story": "Leader of Nazar who guards the Celestial Palace.", "skills": [{"name": "Wrath Sanction", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_886fc87f5a6bb8be73d7ff0f1265368d.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 62, "tagname": "Buff", "tagrgb": "79,156,184"}], "cdcost": "", "desc": "Kaja achieves Wrath Sanction every 6s. His next Basic Attack will send lightning at enemies, dealing <span style=\"color:#7f62fe\">Magic Damage</span> equal to 100<span style=\"color:#62f8fe\"> (+100% Total Magic Power)</span> plus 4% of targets' Max HP and <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">paralyzing</span> them. The lightning will jump to enemies nearby as well (up to 3 times).\n\nIncreases damage by 200% of targets' Max HP on Minions and Creeps.\n\n<span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Paralyze</span>: Slows enemy heroes and summons while reducing their damage by 2.5% (up to 6 stacks) for 5s."}, {"name": "Ring of Order", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_17653d39e18c367eb027863afa142fe8.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 32, "tagname": "AOE", "tagrgb": "199,121,85"}, {"tagid": 22, "tagname": "Slow", "tagrgb": "205,93,109"}], "cdcost": "CD: 5.5   Mana Cost: 50", "desc": "Kaja releases a Ringed Electric Blade that quickly expands and contracts, dealing 135<span style=\"color:#62f8fe\"> (+70% Total Magic Power)</span> <span style=\"color:#7f62fe\">Magic Damage</span> to enemies hit on its way out and back and <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">paralyzing</span> them. Enemies hit will also have their positions revealed briefly.\nEach time Electric Blade deals damage, Kaja restores 100 HP (decays to 30% after multiple hits)."}, {"name": "Lightning Bomb", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_a4e4ae951469d8f7ea8719442a8830a7.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 81, "tagname": "Mobility", "tagrgb": "162,105,198"}, {"tagid": 33, "tagname": "Damage", "tagrgb": "199,121,85"}], "cdcost": "CD: 13   Mana Cost: 65", "desc": "Kaja dashes in the target direction while leaving 3 Lightning Bombs along the way. The Bombs will explode upon enemy contact, dealing 150<span style=\"color:#62f8fe\"> (+35% Total Magic Power)</span> <span style=\"color:#7f62fe\">Magic Damage</span> to the enemies and <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">paralyzing</span> them."}, {"name": "Divine Judgment", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_97e2b721acd4d9ce8180dafdebd0954f.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 21, "tagname": "CC", "tagrgb": "205,93,109"}, {"tagid": 62, "tagname": "Buff", "tagrgb": "79,156,184"}], "cdcost": "CD: 60   Mana Cost: 150", "desc": "Kaja deals 200<span style=\"color:#62f8fe\"> (+80% Total Magic Power)</span> <span style=\"color:#7f62fe\">Magic Damage</span> to a designated enemy hero, suppresses and <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">paralyzes</span> them for 1.5s.\n\nDuring the suppression, Kaja can drag the enemy hero along with him."}], "fullbuilds": [{"items": [{"name": "Arcane Boots - Dire Hit", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_f3f0e21fd8ac1f377bfe97feccbed1e4.png"}, {"name": "Holy Crystal", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_25c17fb08406548b8476673ce7fc3078.png"}, {"name": "Divine Glaive", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_ef0ab8d629f06ebd67cf2b65e144f803.png"}, {"name": "Starlium Scythe", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_d63b065df23070a6b69328482efc6efa.png"}, {"name": "Lightning Truncheon", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_ff18dc8e5abef3934886191fe6c161a0.png"}, {"name": "Blood Wings", "icon": "